&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 14px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;EY新日本有限責任監査法人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 28px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 203px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 14px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;吉　岡　昌　樹&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 28px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 203px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 14px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;佐　伯　麻　里&lt;/p&gt;
